        $existingRecord.status = 'The original LinkedIn detail now redirects to an expired-job list; the official careers page does not expose a matching ATS requisition. The former brief covered Brand & Retail Assets, marketing/digital content, packaging, product documentation, corporate/internal communications, presentations and templates; Spanish/English and salary were not published'
        $existingRecord.contact = 'Closed original detail: https://es.linkedin.com/jobs/view/graphic-designer-at-stark-future-sl-4424557342 ; official employer careers: https://careers.starkfuture.com/ ; historical HR contact: HR@starkfuture.com'
        $existingRecord.analysis = 'Keep in closed/history and future re-open monitoring only. Do not apply through the expired LinkedIn URL or infer that the former requisition remains open; if a new official ATS appears, create a fresh status update after opening it.'
